('', 'Adrestes. Step forward.', 211386, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 180958, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Longer still since we have christened a new temple.', 211385, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 180956, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our mission never changed. For eons, we have done the Master\'s bidding in secret across countless realities.', '', 211383, 0, 0, 0, 102, 0, 180948, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'There was truth in her words, but I did not listen.', 211377, 0, 0, 0, 38, 0, 0, 180929, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
