('What are you doing, muckborn?', 'What are you doing, muckborn?', 211073, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 180534, 180535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'So they just leave these lying around?', 211072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 180475, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
