('', 'Meh. The dead mother trope is such lazy writing.', 211064, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 180489, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You\'re pretty good at this gig, Miss Wings!', '', 211063, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 180435, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Done so soon? Impressive!', 'Done so soon? Impressive!', 211062, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 180544, 180545, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well I think we\'ve had a breakthrough! Good session.', 211061, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 180488, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I... Yes, I was.', 211060, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 180569, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
