('', 'I was. Their legacy will always be a part of me.', 208471, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 179866, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You were of the Frostwolf Clan in life, were you not?', '', 208470, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 180025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('He left it to me as a gift. One of many he gave me.', '', 208466, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 180024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I see you wear the armor of Orgrim Doomhammer.', 208465, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 179865, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
