('', 'Greetings, and welcome to the Mythic Dungeon Invitational!\n\nI can teleport you directly into any Shadowlands dungeon.\n\nMake sure you have Mythic difficulty selected before teleporting.', 207478, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
