('Are you sure? This action cannot be undone.', 'Are you sure? This action cannot be undone.', 206987, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I know my way around the Sanctum. |cFFFF0000<Skip ahead in the campaign chapter to meet your first soulbind.>|r', 'I know my way around the Sanctum. |cFFFF0000<Skip ahead in the campaign chapter to meet your first soulbind.>|r', 206986, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_soullink:20|tLord Stavros casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:331634|h[Dark Recital]|h|r on you!', '|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warlock_soullink:20|tLord Stavros casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:331634|h[Dark Recital]|h|r on you!', 206973, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Are you sure you want to leave the Halls of Atonement?', 'Are you sure you want to leave the Halls of Atonement?', 206972, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Think you\'re a trend setter? Visit Warpweaver Ta\'oren or any Transmogrifier to enter the Trial of Style!', 'Think you\'re a trend setter? Visit Warpweaver Ta\'oren or any Transmogrifier to enter the Trial of Style!', 206946, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Master of Conflict', 'Master of Conflict', 206907, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('If you have time for conversation, then you have time for training! Never remain idle!', '', 206906, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('It is your duty as an exemplary soldier to lead others into battle. Show them the true meaning of strength!', '', 206905, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Primus would be honored to fight alongside one such as you, $p.', '', 206904, 0, 0, 1, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
