('', 'What is it?', 203949, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 164349, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Very well.  We have our weapon. Now we shall hone it.', '', 203915, 0, 0, 0, 102, 0, 164314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Leave him to me.  You\'ve seen what he is capable of, when he believes in the cause.  A measure of patience may yield... superior results.', 203913, 0, 0, 0, 102, 0, 0, 164313, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...All that matters is we now possess the necessary instrument. We must begin its preparation.', '', 203912, 0, 0, 0, 102, 0, 164312, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Go!', 'Go!', 203907, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('1...', '1...', 203906, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('2...', '2...', 203905, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('3...', '3...', 203904, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Mephiles! You incompetent fool!', '', 203890, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 164051, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'The example we set for all of the Shadowlands is borne through your actions. Well done.', 203852, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 164085, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We call to you now, mortal. An act of service is all that is required. Will you answer?', 203851, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 164084, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Centurions! Advance! Destroy the intruders!', 203824, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 164327, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Trust the Purpose.', '', 203811, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164015, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Blessed be her voice.', '', 203810, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164016, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fate guides us all.', '', 203809, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164017, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please keep our corridors tidy.', '', 203808, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164018, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Eternal City must be protected.', '', 203807, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164019, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Purpose must be followed.', '', 203806, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164020, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What do you seek, mortal?', '', 203804, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164021, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Arbiter watches over all.', '', 203803, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164022, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I have been instructed to assist you.', '', 203802, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164023, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You are welcome in Oribos.', '', 203801, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Please, leave me alone... all alone in the night.', '', 203800, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 164025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes... You are right. I cannot wield such power. But we can.', '', 203779, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 164410, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Yes, Prince Renathal. You do know him. And what his lust for power made him become.', 203778, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 164407, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You know my power. Embrace it. Be one with me... again.', '', 203777, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 164404, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Renathal...', '', 203776, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 164403, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Will it be enough? We do not yet possess all of the medallions.', 203775, 0, 0, 1, 70, 0, 0, 164406, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Not yet. If we retreat, we lose more than merely this citadel.', '', 203774, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 164409, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Kel\'Thuzad\'s puppets will be breach the outer wall soon. We should consider a retreat.', 203773, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 164408, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Fixated_State_Green.blp:20|t A Fleeting Spirit fixates on you!', '|TInterface\\ICONS\\Ability_Fixated_State_Green.blp:20|t A Fleeting Spirit fixates on you!', 203766, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Do not... let them... aaarrggghh!', 'Do not... let them... aaarrggghh!', 203716, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 165107, 165108, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We have them! FIRE!', 203714, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 165104, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Defend your margrave!', 'Defend your margrave!', 203713, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 165102, 165103, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Incompetent fools! Defend your house!', 'Incompetent fools! Defend your house!', 203712, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 165100, 165101, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('GRAAAAHH!', 'GRAAAAHH!', 203711, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 165098, 165099, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'He conspires with outside forces and defies the will of the Primus! Today he will answer for his crimes!', 203629, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 165813, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Defenders of Maldraxxus! Through deceit and treachery, Kel\'Thuzad has turned our great houses against one another.', 203628, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 0, 165812, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('For Maldraxxus!', '', 203508, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Victory will be claimed not by a single house, but through the strength of our covenant.', '', 203507, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166028, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Duty is a mantle worn by all who serve.', '', 203501, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166025, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Might without control is wasted.', '', 203498, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Enemies arise from without and within.', '', 203497, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166026, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Focus. Strategy. Relentlessness.', '', 203496, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166027, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The vessels... of Domination.', '', 203495, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166149, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('...and a crown fit for the king of the damned.', '', 203494, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166148, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Yes. Your finest mourneblade...', '', 203493, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166147, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The secret that the First Ones sought to hide.', '', 203492, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166146, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Your grandest design... to claim the final prize.', '', 203491, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166145, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('(screams in pain)', '', 203490, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166806, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But I require... more.', '', 203489, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166144, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Countless secrets extracted. Insidious designs forged into weapons for my armies.', '', 203488, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166143, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('But even a broken thing can be made to serve.', '', 203487, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166142, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Fool. Your mind is already broken.', '', 203486, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166141, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will not break... I will not break... I will not...', '', 203485, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 166805, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Look at you. Pathetic. A puppet dancing on strings.', '', 203484, 0, 0, 1, 6, 0, 166140, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('<Groan.>', '', 203483, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 163376, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Well... I think it\'s time we all sang with you.', 203458, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 163473, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I once said that your voice is but one bird singing in the night.', 203457, 0, 0, 0, 4, 0, 0, 163472, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pricking', 'Pricking', 203405, 0, 0, 0, 65, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You may enjoy the court if you\'d like.', 'You may enjoy the court if you\'d like.', 203399, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Baine! No!', '', 203393, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 163177, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Unworthy.', '', 203356, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 166151, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Pitiful mortal. I find your spirit...', '', 203355, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 166150, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We all have a duty to fulfill.', '', 203324, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 163037, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('There is much to be done.', '', 203309, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 163036, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We stand together against the darkness.', '', 203307, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 163035, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I will aid you as best I can.', '', 203306, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 163034, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('What news?', '', 203305, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 163033, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We will face whatever comes.', '', 203304, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 163032, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
