('', 'But some have fallen so far as to wield the power of the Maw itself.', 198585, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 156045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It appears you have a part to play in all of this, mortal. Let us see what comes of it. Go in service.', 198584, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 156050, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Paragons, return to your temples. Adrestes, monitor the wards.', 198583, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 156049, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What you speak of is unthinkable. But we must remain vigilant, nonetheless.', 198582, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 156048, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'We do not know when or where the Forsworn will strike next. But strike, they will.', 198581, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 156047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
