('', 'Not only are you a mentor to those around you, but also a stalwart defender of Bastion.', 197480, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 155189, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Aspirant Kleia. Step forward.', 197478, 0, 0, 0, 70, 0, 0, 155188, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do you have a Purpose? I will be happy to provide one... when you LEAVE.', 197444, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159761, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Tell me... are you planning a return to the Maw anytime soon?', 197442, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159760, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Go in peace. GO... in peace.', 197435, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159759, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I have observed you mortals to be most... persistent.', 197433, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159758, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Until we speak again.', 197431, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159750, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will consider your words.', 197427, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159749, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
