('', 'Denathrius will know true penance.', 197236, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 158660, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Bring Light to this darkness.', 197235, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 158659, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Speak, child. The shadows have yet to claim me.', 197234, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 158662, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'However faint, the Light shines on.', 197233, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 158661, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Welcome, my fellow doomed friend.', '', 197225, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160710, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I miss the good old days when we were all just trying to destroy each other for power.', '', 197224, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160712, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('And what can this humble fallen prince do for you today?', '', 197222, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160709, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Darkest greetings, Maw Walker.', '', 197221, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160708, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Ah! Our potential savior of the Shadowlands has arrived.', '', 197220, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160707, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Come closer, my new friend.', '', 197219, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160706, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The drought, the lack of souls, the Jailer, all connected.', '', 197218, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160703, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('We are doomed. But not without a fight.', '', 197217, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160702, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('You and me against the end of reality... we might need some help.', '', 197216, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160701, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I look upon you and dare to feel... hope.', '', 197215, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 160700, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The treasonous shall be brought to justice.', '', 197214, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 159265, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The Master is watching.', '', 197213, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 159264, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Stoneborn are nothing without orders.', '', 197212, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 159267, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('I serve, because others forgot how to.', '', 197211, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 159266, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Somehow, we forgot how to be venthyr. We need to remember.', 197210, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 157995, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Revendreth is a servant of two masters.', 197208, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 157993, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Take me with you.', 197206, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159565, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I once dueled a sentient ooze.', 197205, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159568, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I once dueled a knight of the void whose blades were made of shadow and screams.', 197204, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159567, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I once dueled a three armed aberration wielding scimitars as hands.', 197203, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159566, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'A blade is a tool. The skill is in the hand that wields it.', 197202, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Guard, turn, parry, dodge, spin, thrust...', 197201, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Revendreth, where no one should know your name.', 197200, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Mind your stance, watch your flank, and never let them see your fear.', 197199, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Do let me know if you come across anything... challenging.', 197198, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159554, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Remember me next time you\'re in for a fight.', 197197, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159553, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I am a blade in need of unsheathing.', 197196, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'What adventure do you need me for today?', 197195, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159564, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'It is quite good to see you.', 197194, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159563, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'In life, I was unbeatable. In death, I am unstoppable.', 197193, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159562, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Clearly you have come seeking the best.', 197192, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159561, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'My blade could be yours to command.', 197189, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159560, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You are so refreshingly... fresh.', 197183, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 159559, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'No one will come between me and my Prince again. No one.', 197166, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 156029, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
