('', 'Every defeat is a lesson.', 194360, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153874, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Strength comes from the heart.', 194359, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153873, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Blood and thunder!', 194357, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Always ready for battle.', 194356, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'For the honor of the Bladesworn.', 194355, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'How goes the fight?', 194353, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Throm-ka!', 194352, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Lok-tar!', 194351, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 153880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Of course you will.', '', 194310, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 155047, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'I will deal with them, sire... harshly.', 194309, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 155368, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Rest assured, this anima will serve a higher purpose.', '', 194308, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 155046, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('The other realms would squander our most precious resource. That won\'t do.', '', 194307, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 155045, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'You deprive your own people of anima and inflict a drought upon all of the Shadowlands!', 194306, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 155057, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('My defiant accuser and her hapless mortal pawn.', '', 194305, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 155044, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Sire?', 194304, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 155367, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Well, what have we here?', '', 194303, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 155043, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'But master, I--', 194302, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 155366, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('Our friend grows... impatient.', '', 194301, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 155042, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'As I explained before, Sire, we cannot rush such a delicate process.', 194300, 0, 0, 0, 6, 0, 0, 155364, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Time moves on, the forest remains.', 194152, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 162558, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Soil well tilled, souls who thrive.', 194151, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 162557, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Like vines, our paths will rejoin.', 194150, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 162556, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
('', 'Even rushing winds must calm.', 194149, 0, 0, 0, 64, 0, 0, 162555, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 39653),
